{"unit_id":"tag:0EW6:proof","translation":"若<MATH_0001>存在，则引理<REF_0001>给出它所处的典范三角（distinguished triangle）。因此只需选取典范三角（distinguished triangle）\n<MATH_0002>\n其中<MATH_0003>。这里映射（map）<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>作用于伴随（adjunction）映射（mapping）<MATH_0006>的结果。映射（map）<MATH_0007>是典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0008>与<MATH_0009>的复合（composition）。引理陈述中的映射（maps）<MATH_0010>及<MATH_0011>是这些映射（maps）的伴随（adjoints）。若将此典范三角（distinguished triangle）限制（restrict）到<MATH_0012>，则映射（map）<MATH_0013>成为同构（isomorphism），依据基变换（base change）定理（引理<REF_0002>），因此映射（map）<MATH_0014>是同构（isomorphism）。由典范三角（distinguished triangle）可见，<MATH_0015>在<MATH_0016>上为同构（isomorphism）。此外，按构造有<MATH_0017>。由于<MATH_0018>及<MATH_0019>都是同构（isomorphisms），断定<MATH_0020>也在茎（stalks）上诱导（induces）同构（isomorphisms），这些茎位于<MATH_0021>的几何点（geometric points）处。因此<MATH_0022>为同构（isomorphism）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n对于最后一项陈述，可将<MATH_0023>替换为<MATH_0024>，将<MATH_0025>替换为<MATH_0026>，将<MATH_0027>替换为典范（canonical）等同（identification）。注意<MATH_0028>及<MATH_0029>诱导（induce）交换（commutative）方块（square）\n<MATH_0030>\n因此，由导出范畴（derived category）的公理，得到虚线箭头（dotted arrow），它给出典范三角（distinguished triangles）的态射（morphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"典范三角"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"典范三角"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"mapping","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjoints","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"典范三角"},{"source_term":"restrict","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_ter