{"unit_id":"tag:0EWL:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节继续平坦性（Flatness）续论第<REF_0001>节的讨论。为方便读者，回顾几乎爆破方块（almost blow up square）是交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n由概形（schemes）组成，满足下列条件：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0002>为闭浸入（closed immersion），它有限呈示（finite presentation），\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0003>为局部主（locally principal）闭子概形（closed subscheme），它属于<MATH_0004>，\n<STRUCT_0005><MATH_0005>固有（proper）且有限呈示（finite presentation），\n<STRUCT_0006>闭子概形（closed subscheme）<MATH_0006>由拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）理想（ideal）切出，该理想由<MATH_0007>的截面（sections）组成，这些截面的支撑（supported）在<MATH_0008>上（性质（Properties）引理<REF_0002>）；该闭子概形是<MATH_0009>沿<MATH_0010>的爆破（blow up）。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n由此得到，态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>诱导（induces）同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0012>。\n\n<STRUCT_0008><STRUCT_0009>\n给出一个判据，判定大（big）fppf 景（site）的导出范畴（derived category）中对象（objects）的“h 层性（h sheafiness）”，该景为<MATH_0013>，属于概形（scheme）<MATH_0014>。在相同的底层范畴（underlying category）上，还有第二个拓扑（topology），即 h 拓扑（topology）（平坦性（Flatness）续论第<REF_0003>节）。回顾，fppf 覆盖（coverings）是 h 覆盖（coverings）（平坦性（Flatness）续论引理<REF_0004>）。因此可考虑态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0015>\n见景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）第<REF_0005>节。特别地，有全忠实（fully faithful）函子（functor）\n<MATH_0016>\n于是可问：此函子（functor）的本质（essential）像（image）是什么？\n\n","allowed_english":["h","fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"almost blow up square","target_term":"几乎爆破方块"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"locally principal","target_term":"局部主"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"supported","target_term":"支撑"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"blow up","target_term":"爆破"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"induces","target_term":"诱导"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"h sheafiness","target_term":"h 层性"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"essential","target_term":"本质"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"almost blow up square","target_term":"几乎爆破方块","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"locally principal","target_term":"局部主","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理